        <![CDATA[<h1>初识 Kubernetes</h1><p>作者：jhlz（xxx@example.com）</p>
        
          <a href="https://kubernetes.io/zh-cn/docs/home/" title="官方文档" target="_blank">官方文档</a>
<h2 id="pod--container">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#pod--container"></a>
Pod &amp; Container
</h2><p>Kubernetes 的最小调度单元是 Pod，在 Pod 中包含多个 Container。</p>
<h3 id="pod-基本操作">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#pod-%e5%9f%ba%e6%9c%ac%e6%93%8d%e4%bd%9c"></a>
Pod 基本操作
</h3><h4 id="查看-pod">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e6%9f%a5%e7%9c%8b-pod"></a>
查看 Pod
</h4><p>pod 默认有 <code>kube-default</code> 和 <code>kube-system</code> 两个命名空间。</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 查询默认 pod</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">kubectl get po<span class="p">|</span>pod<span class="p">|</span>pods
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 查询指定命名空间的所有 pod</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">kubectl get pods -n <span class="o">[</span>namspace<span class="o">]</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 查询当前命名空间的所有 pod</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">kubectl get pods -A
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 查看指定命名空间下 pod 的详细信息</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">kubectl get pod -o wide -n <span class="o">[</span>namspace<span class="o">]</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 查看所有命名空间下 pod 的详细信息</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">kubectl get pod -o wide -A
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 查看指定 pod 的详细信息（不能查看 pod 中的具体容器，pod 为最小管理单元）</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">kubectl describe pod <span class="o">[</span>pod-name<span class="o">]</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id="创建-pod">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%88%9b%e5%bb%ba-pod"></a>
<a href="https://kubernetes.io/zh-cn/docs/reference/kubernetes-api/workload-resources/pod-v1/">创建 Pod</a>
</h4><p>先说一种不常用的方式，这种方式很 docker，该方式生产中一般不用。</p>
        
